'''Chroma Laser''' is a [[Chroma Weapons|chroma]] gun that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Gun Box 3]] or through [[trading]].

== Appearance ==
Its appearance is based on a real-life laser tag gun. It has a small trigger, and the bottom of the gun handle has an extra detail that alternates in color like some of the other parts of this gun.

== Trivia ==
*This is [[Nikilis]]' favorite gun.
*Like many other [[Chroma Weapons]], it was a victim of [[the Duping Glitch (2021)]].
*It partners with the chroma knife [[Chroma Slasher]], making the [https://murder-mystery-2.fandom.com/wiki/Murder_Mystery_2_Wiki:Wiki-Bot/Chroma_Slasher_Set Chroma Slasher Set].
*It is the chroma counterpart of the [[Godly Weapons|godly]] gun under the name [[Laser (Godly)|Laser]], which can be found in the same box.
*Its model derives from the limited Roblox gear [https://www.roblox.com/catalog/130113146/Hyperlaser-Gun Hyperlaser Gun]. However, it has been altered from a bright blue color to a color-alternating texture.
*
*It was released along with the [[Season 1]] update.
*Like all the other [[Chroma Weapons]], it is not salvageable in the crafting station.

